{"candidateAnswer":"Susie and Seraphim","evidence":"[D2:20 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: I want to show you one of my snakes! They always calm me down and make me happy. This is Susie.\n[D2:22 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene:  I was playing video games and my pet just slinked out of her cage and coiled up next to me - it was too funny! My second snake Seraphim did it. Look at her sly eyes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:ab9bb7b7-6fba-5f67-a89e-db42509d7170","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0bb03a6efaca190e817886ddc4d89037e0c5165deb56da1cd4cd00dffac4c6d2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of Jolene's snakes?","referenceAnswer":"Susie, Seraphim","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0bb03a6efaca190e817886ddc4d89037e0c5165deb56da1cd4cd00dffac4c6d2"}}]}